  "display_title": "A Turbulent Affair",
  "description": "After losing her father, Yeon-Su struggles to support her sick mother and little sister alone. Desperate for money to save her family, she accepts a life-changing offer to be the surrogate of a handsome rich man named Tae-Gun and his infertile wife.The contract seems simple at first, but Yeon-Su soon realizes she's trapped in an arrangement she’ll regret. By the time she's questioning her morality and self-worth, it's already too late to turn back. As forbidden intimacy blurs the lines, unexpected emotions begin to stir between Yeon-Su and Tae-Gun. But is anything real between them?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
